::PC_U04_L01_GP_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U04_L01_GP_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.PA.1
Question:
Which representation best supports conic reasoning for item.
{
~A. Choose a conic name before reading the equation#This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
=B. Identify the conic form, its key features, and how those features appear on the graph#Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
~C. Use only the first coefficient and ignore signs#This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~D. Treat every second-degree equation as a circle#This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
}

